WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:54.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:55.000 --> 00:58.000
"Not Yours"

3
00:58.100 --> 01:00.800
(Episode 2)

4
01:28.200 --> 01:29.319
Sorry about that, sir.

5
01:29.640 --> 01:30.760
That spot is a bit ticklish.

6
01:33.079 --> 01:35.200
Finally found your weak spot.

7
01:37.239 --> 01:38.239
Sir,

8
01:38.480 --> 01:39.999
could you skip that spot?

9
01:40.000 --> 01:41.016
Work somewhere else, please.

10
01:41.040 --> 01:42.040
Thanks.

11
01:42.760 --> 01:43.760
Sure.

12
01:44.400 --> 01:45.400
You got it.

13
01:45.439 --> 01:47.920
You're the one who asked for somewhere else.

14
01:55.879 --> 01:56.879
Young man,

15
01:57.400 --> 01:59.000
your leg muscles are pretty solid.

16
01:59.239 --> 02:00.679
You must hit the gym a lot.

17
02:00.680 --> 02:02.359
I don't really work out that much.

18
02:03.599 --> 02:04.798
Yeah, right.

19
02:04.799 --> 02:06.438
You don't get muscle tone like that without lifting.

20
02:06.439 --> 02:07.560
What a poser.

21
02:07.760 --> 02:09.919
One look at your legs and I can tell you train hard.

22
02:10.159 --> 02:11.159
Don't kid a kidder.

23
02:11.639 --> 02:14.879
Maybe it's because I was a sports major in college.

24
02:42.400 --> 02:43.719
A sports major, huh?

25
02:44.199 --> 02:45.560
So was I back in the day.

26
02:46.159 --> 02:47.400
What a coincidence!

27
02:49.159 --> 02:51.519
Still, it's pretty common for sports majors to change careers.

28
02:51.520 --> 02:53.038
A lot of my classmates

29
02:53.039 --> 02:54.959
went from paying customers to service providers.

30
02:55.400 --> 02:58.319
I guess they know better where the aches are

31
02:58.680 --> 02:59.960
and can really target the spots.

32
03:03.759 --> 03:05.599
All right, please turn over.

33
03:06.000 --> 03:07.960
Let me help you thoroughly loosen up.

34
03:08.840 --> 03:09.840
Sounds good.

35
03:10.680 --> 03:12.879
Works out, since I've been dancing all day.

36
03:14.319 --> 03:15.759
My body is aching.

37
03:21.879 --> 03:24.159
A busy CEO like you

38
03:24.360 --> 03:25.800
still finds time for dance practice?

39
03:25.960 --> 03:27.360
A CEO?

40
03:28.719 --> 03:29.919
I'm not a CEO.

41
03:31.080 --> 03:32.080
Huh?

42
03:32.479 --> 03:33.599
You're not the boss?

43
03:37.479 --> 03:39.959
Hey, brushing against a sensitive spot happens.

44
03:39.960 --> 03:40.960
We're both guys.

45
03:41.280 --> 03:42.520
No need to make a scene.

46
03:42.719 --> 03:44.120
I'll switch to another spot, okay?

47
03:51.479 --> 03:52.159
By the way,

48
03:52.280 --> 03:53.919
why did you just call me a CEO?

49
03:54.319 --> 03:56.080
Aren't you the boss of Yingyu Group?

50
03:56.960 --> 03:57.960
No, I'm not.

51
03:58.199 --> 03:59.199
Who is it?

52
03:59.479 --> 04:00.960
I'm Master Chen, your masseur.

53
04:01.199 --> 04:01.840
I'm so sorry.

54
04:01.840 --> 04:02.680
I was held up earlier,

55
04:02.759 --> 04:03.878
so I'm a bit late.

56
04:03.879 --> 04:04.360
Shoot.

57
04:04.360 --> 04:05.280
The real masseur is here.

58
04:05.360 --> 04:06.560
Something urgent just came up.

59
04:06.639 --> 04:08.199
Another masseur will take over for you.

60
04:14.686 --> 04:16.525
Wait, what did you smear all over...

61
06:17.959 --> 06:18.759
Bro,

62
06:18.800 --> 06:20.240
Little sister and I already ate.

63
06:20.439 --> 06:21.560
This is for you.

64
06:22.199 --> 06:23.199
Don't worry.

65
06:23.360 --> 06:25.240
I'll take good care of my sister and myself.

66
06:25.360 --> 06:26.680
You don't need to worry about us.

67
06:27.480 --> 06:28.760
Thanks for working so hard, Bro.

68
07:21.743 --> 07:23.123
[Calling Mom]

69
07:25.240 --> 07:26.040
We're sorry.

70
07:26.041 --> 07:28.879
The number you dialed is temporarily unavailable.

71
08:09.160 --> 08:11.000
It's been so long since I last saw the stars.

72
08:45.120 --> 08:46.000
Doctor,

73
08:46.120 --> 08:47.999
the young master hasn't had an allergy flare-up in years.

74
08:48.000 --> 08:49.879
Why did it get so severe all of a sudden?

75
08:50.480 --> 08:52.399
I reviewed Boss P'Eng's recent diet.

76
08:52.840 --> 08:54.255
To look lean on camera for his appearances,

77
08:54.279 --> 08:55.799
his diet has been far too restrictive,

78
08:55.840 --> 08:58.200
causing malnutrition and lowering his immune defenses.

79
08:58.360 --> 08:59.878
He already has a seafood allergy,

80
08:59.879 --> 09:01.679
specifically to shrimp.

81
09:01.759 --> 09:03.960
Today's intake was clearly far past his threshold.

82
09:04.240 --> 09:06.759
We're fortunate we managed to stabilize him in time.

83
09:10.720 --> 09:12.440
Mingkun.

84
09:13.279 --> 09:13.919
Young Master.

85
09:14.080 --> 09:15.080
Please just rest.

86
09:15.200 --> 09:16.200
Don't try to speak.

87
09:16.639 --> 09:17.895
No matter how urgent things are,

88
09:17.919 --> 09:19.639
it can wait until you're back on your feet.

89
09:23.399 --> 09:25.120
All right.

90
09:26.759 --> 09:28.120
Mingkun.

91
10:23.559 --> 10:24.839
"Regarding compensation,

92
10:24.840 --> 10:26.080
please get in touch with me.

93
10:26.480 --> 10:27.480
Here is my number.

94
10:28.000 --> 10:29.120
I am truly sorry.

95
10:29.240 --> 10:31.320
We never imagined something like this would happen.

96
10:43.759 --> 10:45.120
I wonder if that guy is okay.

97
10:46.639 --> 10:48.159
The driver must have found him, right?

98
10:50.360 --> 10:53.200
Should I call and check?

99
10:59.360 --> 11:00.360
Mr. Mingkun,

100
11:00.799 --> 11:03.240
Boss P'Eng seems to have an urgent matter.

101
11:04.399 --> 11:05.519
What else could it be?

102
11:05.759 --> 11:07.119
He wants to track down that boy again,

103
11:07.120 --> 11:07.879
demanding to know

104
11:07.880 --> 11:09.775
why he broke his promise and didn't go back to him.

105
11:09.799 --> 11:11.239
He even swore the kid is a dead man,

106
11:11.519 --> 11:13.320
ordering me to locate him tonight.

107
11:14.759 --> 11:17.440
Anyone who betrays or crosses him has to pay with their life.

108
11:18.200 --> 11:19.200
Oh.

109
11:24.360 --> 11:25.360
Hello?

110
11:26.519 --> 11:27.519
Hello.

111
11:28.039 --> 11:29.639
Is this Mr. Mingkun?

112
11:30.399 --> 11:31.879
I'm the flower vendor from earlier.

113
11:32.960 --> 11:34.559
Is your boss feeling all right now?

114
11:35.279 --> 11:36.279
He's fine now.

115
11:36.360 --> 11:37.720
He received proper medical care.

116
11:37.879 --> 11:38.879
Thank you for asking.

117
11:39.600 --> 11:40.600
Listen...

118
11:41.120 --> 11:42.120
Mr. Pao,

119
11:42.159 --> 11:43.879
you'd better watch your back lately.

120
11:44.200 --> 11:45.480
Brace yourself for the worst.

121
11:46.080 --> 11:47.319
What do you mean, brace myself?

122
11:47.320 --> 11:48.360
What do you mean by that?

123
11:48.960 --> 11:50.000
What I mean is...

124
11:51.759 --> 11:52.999
Just be ready for anything.

125
11:53.000 --> 11:54.960
I'll do what I can to smooth things over for you,

126
11:55.840 --> 11:57.360
so try not to stress too much.

127
11:58.799 --> 12:00.159
Be ready?

128
12:00.320 --> 12:01.600
For what?

129
12:02.120 --> 12:03.480
That makes zero sense.

130
12:05.399 --> 12:06.399
Whatever.

131
12:06.679 --> 12:08.480
I should worry about my own problems first.

132
12:09.559 --> 12:13.600
When will I ever be powerful like him,

133
12:14.039 --> 12:15.399
with endless money to burn?

134
12:18.399 --> 12:20.039
My life is so miserable.

135
12:27.320 --> 12:28.039
Xiaobei!

136
12:28.240 --> 12:28.960
Xiaobei!

137
12:28.960 --> 12:29.960
Are you home?

138
12:32.600 --> 12:33.879
He's sleeping.

139
12:36.480 --> 12:37.480
Xiaobei!

140
12:38.519 --> 12:39.519
Xiaobei!

141
12:42.399 --> 12:42.919
Hurry!

142
12:42.919 --> 12:43.480
Xiaobei,

143
12:43.759 --> 12:45.079
wake up!

144
12:45.080 --> 12:47.080
I've got the craziest, funniest story to tell you!

145
12:47.159 --> 12:48.319
What is it?

146
12:48.320 --> 12:50.240
Waking someone up at the crack of dawn...

147
12:50.639 --> 12:51.279
Come on,

148
12:51.559 --> 12:52.679
get up!

149
12:53.480 --> 12:54.480
Snap out of it!

150
12:55.159 --> 12:56.960
Trust me, this is hilarious.

151
12:57.120 --> 13:00.120
Yesterday, I totally pranked that narcissistic soy sauce CEO.

152
13:01.440 --> 13:02.440
Huh?

153
13:19.480 --> 13:20.895
Why did you prepare so much breakfast?

154
13:20.919 --> 13:22.279
Didn't I say I'm cutting fat?

155
13:22.799 --> 13:24.159
Is this portion meant for a pig?

156
13:24.360 --> 13:25.518
Young Master,

157
13:25.519 --> 13:27.239
the doctor specifically emphasized last night

158
13:27.240 --> 13:28.638
that your recent malnutrition

159
13:28.639 --> 13:30.278
has severely weakened your immune system,

160
13:30.279 --> 13:31.798
triggering that intense allergic reaction.

161
13:31.799 --> 13:34.399
He insisted we make sure you receive adequate nutrition.

162
13:34.720 --> 13:37.279
We don't expect you to finish everything here.

163
13:37.559 --> 13:39.000
It's just that...

164
13:39.360 --> 13:41.600
your appetite is like Manchester's weather—

165
13:41.799 --> 13:42.839
completely unpredictable.

166
13:42.840 --> 13:45.320
So please, choose whatever suits your fancy.

167
13:45.505 --> 13:46.825
You've been by my side this long,

168
13:47.320 --> 13:48.758
and you still don't know my taste?

169
13:48.759 --> 13:49.759
Forgive me, Young Master.

170
13:52.080 --> 13:54.679
I only know your taste in boys.

171
13:59.519 --> 14:01.278
That flower kid who ran off last night...

172
14:01.279 --> 14:02.279
Did you find him?

173
14:02.360 --> 14:03.279
Reporting, Young Master.

174
14:03.280 --> 14:05.239
Last night, that Mr. Pao

175
14:05.240 --> 14:06.878
even called to check on how you were doing.

176
14:06.879 --> 14:08.639
He's clearly terrified by now.

177
14:09.039 --> 14:11.639
Why not be magnanimous and let it slide this once?

178
14:11.879 --> 14:13.878
There's no need to lower yourself to a street vendor's level.

179
14:13.879 --> 14:15.639
He's just acting out of a guilty conscience.

180
14:16.080 --> 14:17.719
Daring to defy my orders?

181
14:17.720 --> 14:18.879
He must have a death wish.

182
14:19.919 --> 14:21.239
If he couldn't get it, he should've just said so.

183
14:21.240 --> 14:22.719
Giving his word and then running away?

184
14:22.720 --> 14:24.640
If you were in my shoes, would you forgive that?

185
14:25.200 --> 14:26.359
If it were me,

186
14:26.360 --> 14:27.759
I would've simply walked away.

187
14:28.360 --> 14:29.559
Besides, I double-checked.

188
14:29.679 --> 14:31.600
The alley where you were smoking last night

189
14:31.879 --> 14:34.639
was barely a hundred meters from our car.

190
14:37.440 --> 14:38.440
I'm not eating.

191
14:38.559 --> 14:39.696
What kind of garbage is this?

192
14:39.720 --> 14:41.560
I told you to get a new chef! Why haven't you?

193
14:41.879 --> 14:42.879
Young Master,

194
14:43.200 --> 14:44.200
please calm down.

195
14:46.200 --> 14:47.798
The chef who made this today

196
14:47.799 --> 14:50.158
is the head chef just brought in from the Mandarin Oriental.

197
14:50.159 --> 14:52.398
He was the silver medalist in the Bocuse d'Or

198
14:52.399 --> 14:54.319
and took bronze in the World Golden Chef Awards.

199
14:54.759 --> 14:58.159
He's already the eighteenth master chef we've hired for you.

200
14:58.240 --> 14:59.679
What good are all those awards?

201
15:00.080 --> 15:01.960
I despise pretentious fluff.

202
15:02.480 --> 15:03.880
I want food meant for human beings!

203
15:04.279 --> 15:05.759
For actual humans, do you understand?

204
15:06.879 --> 15:07.999
It seems...

205
15:08.000 --> 15:08.919
you still...

206
15:08.920 --> 15:11.600
prefer the home-cooked meals Madam used to make for you.

207
15:12.480 --> 15:13.480
Right?

208
15:16.639 --> 15:17.639
Take it away.

209
15:18.039 --> 15:20.039
Just find someone who can cook to my palate, fast.

210
15:20.639 --> 15:22.000
And that boy from yesterday—

211
15:22.159 --> 15:23.439
I want him in front of me today.

212
15:24.559 --> 15:25.720
I'm going to make him...

213
15:26.240 --> 15:27.480
pay with his life.

214
15:33.440 --> 15:34.440
Hey!

215
15:34.519 --> 15:35.159
I'm talking to you!

216
15:35.159 --> 15:36.159
Did you hear me?

217
15:36.399 --> 15:38.599
Come over here and report directly to the young master.

218
15:40.759 --> 15:41.480
Reporting, Young Master.

219
15:41.639 --> 15:42.320
Understood, sir.

220
15:42.639 --> 15:44.239
I'll have the stable hands

221
15:44.240 --> 15:46.000
bring out all five of our horses right away.

222
15:46.240 --> 15:47.240
Bring them out for what?

223
15:47.559 --> 15:48.840
Did I say I wanted to ride?

224
15:50.279 --> 15:51.359
No, Young Master.

225
15:51.360 --> 15:52.479
Not for you to ride.

226
15:52.480 --> 15:54.239
They're for that boy.

227
15:54.240 --> 15:55.080
Once we track him down,

228
15:55.081 --> 15:57.655
we'll have him drawn and quartered by five horses, just as you ordered.

229
15:57.679 --> 15:58.759
Rest assured, sir.

230
16:01.759 --> 16:02.759
Pardon the interruption, Young Master.

231
16:02.760 --> 16:04.240
There is an urgent matter to report.

232
16:04.519 --> 16:05.519
Speak.

233
16:06.240 --> 16:07.159
Madam's...

234
16:07.160 --> 16:09.360
The diamond ring left behind by Madam...

235
16:10.120 --> 16:11.000
is gone.

236
16:11.001 --> 16:12.159
Gone?

237
16:14.080 --> 16:15.678
Isn't it locked in the study's safe?

238
16:15.679 --> 16:16.559
How could it go missing?

239
16:16.560 --> 16:17.879
It appears...

240
16:18.120 --> 16:20.359
it was taken by Master Pao, the gardener.

241
16:20.360 --> 16:22.319
Surveillance footage shows only she entered the study,

242
16:22.320 --> 16:24.080
and she had the key.

243
16:24.559 --> 16:26.416
She just tends the garden! How could she have a key?

244
16:26.440 --> 16:29.200
We're not sure either, sir.

245
16:30.600 --> 16:31.895
Do you know Aunt Pao's whereabouts?

246
16:31.919 --> 16:33.000
Or her home address?

247
16:33.720 --> 16:34.840
Yes, sir.

248
16:35.759 --> 16:36.440
Young Master,

249
16:36.600 --> 16:38.119
the top priority right now

250
16:38.120 --> 16:39.759
is recovering Madam's ring.

251
16:40.279 --> 16:41.759
Let me dispatch a search party first.

252
16:41.879 --> 16:42.879
Wait for my word.

253
16:43.240 --> 16:45.638
That jinx from last night must have cursed me.

254
16:45.639 --> 16:47.399
Nothing but trouble ever since.

255
16:49.320 --> 16:50.039
Follow me.

256
16:50.120 --> 16:50.639
Young Master!

257
16:50.639 --> 16:51.639
Young...

258
16:56.360 --> 16:57.360
And guess what?

259
16:57.679 --> 16:59.558
I grabbed the soy sauce his own company makes

260
16:59.559 --> 17:01.279
and gave him an "essential oil" massage!

261
17:02.039 --> 17:03.879
He was drenched in soy sauce from head to toe!

262
17:04.079 --> 17:06.039
The soy sauce boss modeling his own product—

263
17:06.400 --> 17:07.480
priceless!

264
17:13.599 --> 17:15.279
Don't you think you went a little too far?

265
17:15.319 --> 17:17.960
He was totally out of line and bullied you yesterday!

266
17:18.599 --> 17:19.839
Plus, he called the cops on me!

267
17:20.359 --> 17:21.799
He had it coming.

268
17:21.839 --> 17:22.960
Serves him right!

269
17:25.880 --> 17:27.720
How can you be so certain

270
17:29.079 --> 17:30.239
that he's the soy sauce boss?

271
17:30.839 --> 17:31.839
Of course he is!

272
17:32.279 --> 17:32.920
I mean...

273
17:33.279 --> 17:35.480
His VIP suite was lined with his company's products.

274
17:35.680 --> 17:37.519
Who else could possibly be that conceited?

275
17:37.920 --> 17:39.119
Then it looks like...

276
17:40.599 --> 17:41.919
I must've seen a ghost yesterday.

277
17:42.720 --> 17:43.720
What do you mean?

278
17:44.119 --> 17:45.119
What ghost?

279
17:47.119 --> 17:49.000
The guy I chased down in that car yesterday...

280
17:49.279 --> 17:50.680
He was also the soy sauce boss.

281
17:51.720 --> 17:53.079
You said you pranked him too,

282
17:53.759 --> 17:57.558
so between the two "soy sauce bosses" we ran into,

283
17:57.559 --> 17:58.640
which one is the real deal?

284
17:59.160 --> 18:01.120
You didn't mistake someone else for him, did you?

285
18:15.799 --> 18:16.920
Wait, what?

286
18:17.200 --> 18:18.759
You ran into the soy sauce boss too?

287
18:19.680 --> 18:21.880
"Works out, since I've been dancing all day."

288
18:23.519 --> 18:24.880
"My body is aching."

289
18:27.079 --> 18:28.838
I think the guy you messed with yesterday...

290
18:28.839 --> 18:30.200
might actually be...

291
18:31.559 --> 18:32.559
Milan.

292
18:37.519 --> 18:38.759
I knew it!

293
18:39.079 --> 18:39.920
I was wondering how Milan got so tall

294
18:39.920 --> 18:40.920
and pale!

295
18:41.759 --> 18:42.759
What do I do now?

296
18:43.480 --> 18:45.480
Revenge went straight to my head

297
18:46.000 --> 18:47.440
and I completely lost my senses!

298
18:55.160 --> 18:56.599
You'd better figure out

299
18:56.680 --> 18:57.920
what you're going to do next.

300
18:59.160 --> 19:00.616
What do you mean, what am I going to do?

301
19:00.640 --> 19:02.200
It's not like he knows who I am anyway.

302
19:13.000 --> 19:14.000
Don't forget,

303
19:14.519 --> 19:16.479
upscale places like that have cameras everywhere.

304
19:16.839 --> 19:19.118
Oh, please. He'd never check the security footage.

305
19:19.119 --> 19:20.119
I know him.

306
19:20.440 --> 19:21.799
He's obsessed with saving face.

307
19:22.160 --> 19:23.480
He's a celebrity, after all.

308
19:24.079 --> 19:26.199
Besides, covered in soy sauce

309
19:26.200 --> 19:27.959
and standing outside in his underwear?

310
19:27.960 --> 19:29.160
How humiliating would that be?

311
19:30.000 --> 19:31.000
He won't.

312
19:31.200 --> 19:32.599
If you say so,

313
19:32.759 --> 19:33.759
then fine.

314
19:34.160 --> 19:35.200
If it were me,

315
19:35.480 --> 19:36.839
I'd definitely call the cops.

316
19:37.359 --> 19:38.440
Call the cops?

317
19:38.920 --> 19:40.119
Isn't that taking it too far?

318
19:41.720 --> 19:42.720
Of course not!

319
19:42.960 --> 19:44.000
Think about it.

320
19:44.119 --> 19:46.159
He doesn't know who your grudge was really against.

321
19:47.160 --> 19:49.160
What if you had a hidden camera on you

322
19:49.440 --> 19:50.799
and leaked the video online?

323
19:51.200 --> 19:52.439
That would destroy his reputation.

324
19:52.440 --> 19:54.200
You always worry over nothing.

325
19:54.559 --> 19:55.639
He's a complete airhead.

326
19:55.640 --> 19:56.960
He wouldn't think that far ahead.

327
20:00.960 --> 20:02.320
If he actually goes to the police,

328
20:02.359 --> 20:03.639
I'll call him Daddy!

329
20:03.640 --> 20:09.118
Daddy!

330
20:09.119 --> 20:11.880
I want my daddy!

331
20:19.160 --> 20:20.160
Hurry up!

332
20:32.279 --> 20:33.279
Here, take this.

333
20:39.200 --> 20:40.200
I want to report a crime!

334
20:52.279 --> 20:53.720
Leave it to you, Pao Bei.

335
20:55.519 --> 20:58.000
Your cooking just keeps getting better.

336
21:00.359 --> 21:01.999
Next time, come over and have them fresh.

337
21:02.359 --> 21:03.639
These buns were frozen for days.

338
21:03.920 --> 21:05.400
They don't taste as good reheated.

339
21:06.720 --> 21:07.319
Bro,

340
21:07.319 --> 21:08.319
we're heading to school.

341
21:09.359 --> 21:10.759
I'll walk the kids out.

342
21:10.880 --> 21:12.518
It's on my way to the police station

343
21:12.519 --> 21:13.599
to retrieve my lottery box.

344
21:14.240 --> 21:15.696
You're heading to the restaurant soon, right?

345
21:15.720 --> 21:16.079
Yeah.

346
21:16.480 --> 21:17.480
Aren't you working today?

347
21:17.640 --> 21:18.640
I took the day off.

348
21:19.119 --> 21:20.439
I sold all the flowers yesterday,

349
21:20.559 --> 21:21.559
so I need to restock.

350
21:22.160 --> 21:22.640
Sounds good.

351
21:22.759 --> 21:24.176
I'll meet you at the night market after work.

352
21:24.200 --> 21:24.640
All right.

353
21:24.720 --> 21:25.279
See you at the night market.

354
21:25.559 --> 21:26.039
Let's go.

355
21:26.400 --> 21:27.000
Say goodbye.

356
21:27.001 --> 21:28.439
Bye, Bro!

357
21:28.440 --> 21:28.880
Off we go.

358
21:28.880 --> 21:29.880
Goodbye!

359
21:32.039 --> 21:33.039
Come on.

360
21:37.960 --> 21:39.200
What a dump.

361
21:40.240 --> 21:41.440
No wonder she steals.

362
21:43.319 --> 21:44.319
Careful, Young Master.

363
21:48.519 --> 21:49.640
You said she lives here?

364
21:49.920 --> 21:50.759
Yes, Young Master.

365
21:50.760 --> 21:52.319
The records point right here.

366
21:53.680 --> 21:54.119
Look,

367
21:54.279 --> 21:56.399
the unit with the row of flowers on the terrace is hers.

368
21:56.400 --> 21:58.000
Playing at romance in a place like this?

369
21:58.640 --> 22:00.359
Flowers look utterly ridiculous here.

370
22:01.559 --> 22:02.119
Young Master,

371
22:02.359 --> 22:04.000
isn't that boy the...

372
22:04.519 --> 22:05.519
Who?

373
22:05.720 --> 22:07.118
The flower-selling kid!

374
22:07.119 --> 22:09.159
The one you said you'd tear apart with five horses!

375
22:09.920 --> 22:10.519
I mean...

376
22:10.799 --> 22:11.920
the kid from yesterday!

377
22:21.440 --> 22:22.720
Talk about rotten luck.

378
22:23.480 --> 22:24.519
He can't blame me.

379
22:25.279 --> 22:26.519
He walked right into my trap.

380
22:26.960 --> 22:29.160
Could he be related to worker surnamed Pao?

381
22:30.720 --> 22:32.360
Now this just got a lot more interesting.

382
22:35.079 --> 22:36.119
Stay here, both of you.

383
22:36.400 --> 22:37.680
I'll handle him myself.

384
22:37.880 --> 22:39.319
Let me come with you, Young Master.

385
22:39.319 --> 22:40.039
No need.

386
22:40.319 --> 22:41.319
I'll deal with him.

387
22:42.359 --> 22:45.176
Otherwise, it'll look like I'm ganging up on him.

388
22:45.200 --> 22:45.960
Hey—.

389
22:45.960 --> 22:46.960
Young Master!

390
23:01.839 --> 23:03.358
They can heat them up themselves.

391
23:03.359 --> 23:04.639
I steamed a big batch this time.

392
23:31.960 --> 23:33.440
What kind of move is this?

393
23:33.920 --> 23:35.640
You think you're a Peashooter or something?

394
23:36.799 --> 23:37.799
What are you doing here?

395
23:41.240 --> 23:42.680
I'm here to settle the score.

396
23:43.440 --> 23:44.000
You...

397
23:44.001 --> 23:46.361
You're trespassing on private property, I'll have you know!

398
23:46.640 --> 23:47.920
I can call the police!

399
23:49.880 --> 23:50.880
Go ahead and call them.

400
23:51.920 --> 23:52.960
Or should I dial for you?

401
23:54.000 --> 23:55.559
That way, they can haul you off.

402
23:57.000 --> 23:58.440
Why would the police arrest me?

403
24:02.839 --> 24:04.359
What is the worker Pao to you?

404
24:09.200 --> 24:10.600
There are lots of people named Pao.

405
24:11.319 --> 24:13.279
How should I know which one you're talking about?

406
24:17.000 --> 24:18.119
This Pao.

407
24:18.440 --> 24:19.440
Your mother.

408
24:20.559 --> 24:22.535
That's my personal business. It's none of your concern.

409
24:22.559 --> 24:23.559
Why do you even care?

410
24:30.960 --> 24:33.000
Take a look at what your mother did.

411
24:34.079 --> 24:35.079
My mom?

412
24:47.640 --> 24:48.680
It's so dark.

413
24:49.359 --> 24:50.519
Who can even see this?

414
24:51.759 --> 24:53.279
Keep playing dumb.

415
24:55.000 --> 24:56.119
Let me tell you something.

416
24:57.079 --> 24:57.839
Your mother,

417
24:58.045 --> 24:59.045
surnamed Pao,

418
24:59.079 --> 25:02.679
stole a priceless diamond ring from my family.

419
25:02.680 --> 25:03.839
Impossible!

420
25:04.359 --> 25:05.759
We might not have much money,

421
25:06.119 --> 25:07.575
but my mom is not that kind of person.

422
25:07.599 --> 25:08.920
She would never steal!

423
25:10.160 --> 25:11.440
I'll call her right now and ask.

424
25:11.759 --> 25:12.759
Just you wait.

425
25:17.960 --> 25:21.279
The number you dialed is switched off.

426
25:27.440 --> 25:30.759
The number you dialed is switched off.

427
25:44.359 --> 25:46.960
These buns are actually delicious.

428
25:53.480 --> 25:54.679
Don't touch our food!

429
25:54.680 --> 25:56.200
Get your facts straight.

430
25:56.680 --> 25:58.280
Your mom stole my family's diamond ring.

431
25:58.640 --> 26:01.000
What's wrong with me eating a bun?

432
26:01.640 --> 26:03.360
Those are for my little brother and sister!

433
26:03.400 --> 26:05.255
If you eat them, they won't have anything left!

434
26:05.279 --> 26:06.640
I'll pay you.

435
26:08.519 --> 26:09.680
I don't want your money!

436
26:14.759 --> 26:15.759
Fine.

437
26:20.920 --> 26:21.920
Well?

438
26:22.279 --> 26:23.759
Can't get through, can you?

439
26:24.240 --> 26:25.600
Her phone is turned off, isn't it?

440
26:27.720 --> 26:29.559
Her battery must have died.

441
26:30.359 --> 26:31.960
Keep making excuses.

442
26:36.279 --> 26:37.519
Won't let me eat your buns?

443
26:38.000 --> 26:39.000
Is that so?

444
26:44.559 --> 26:45.799
What are you doing?!

445
26:46.200 --> 26:48.080
Didn't you want to save them for your siblings?

446
26:48.960 --> 26:50.680
Then you'll pay off the debt with yourself!

447
26:52.319 --> 26:53.376
What do you think you're doing?!

448
26:53.400 --> 26:54.400
Put me down!

449
26:54.440 --> 26:55.440
I'm not going!

450
26:55.480 --> 26:56.480
I'm not going!

451
26:56.559 --> 26:57.559
Put me down!

452
26:59.200 --> 27:00.160
Put me down!

453
27:00.160 --> 27:01.160
I won't go!

454
27:02.000 --> 27:03.319
Put me down right now!

455
27:04.319 --> 27:05.758
Young Master, why are you carrying him out?

456
27:05.759 --> 27:06.319
Put me down!

457
27:06.319 --> 27:06.799
Young Master!

458
27:07.079 --> 27:08.079
I won't go!

459
27:08.200 --> 27:09.439
Young Master, please put him down!

460
27:09.440 --> 27:10.440
Put me down!

461
27:11.279 --> 27:11.799
Put me down!

462
27:11.799 --> 27:12.200
Young Master,

463
27:12.799 --> 27:13.839
just put him down first!

464
27:17.440 --> 27:18.440
You people...

465
27:18.519 --> 27:20.318
You need to know what money is clean to make

466
27:20.319 --> 27:21.400
and what isn't.

467
27:21.880 --> 27:23.720
If this blows up, you'll be locked up.

468
27:24.400 --> 27:25.160
Understood.

469
27:25.184 --> 27:26.184
I'll definitely remember.

470
27:27.720 --> 27:28.720
Sign the registry over there,

471
27:28.721 --> 27:29.976
and you can take your things back.

472
27:30.000 --> 27:31.000
Okay.

473
27:32.200 --> 27:32.799
Name?

474
27:33.079 --> 27:34.079
Jiang Weibang.

475
28:07.519 --> 28:08.758
Young Master, please put him down.

476
28:08.759 --> 28:09.599
Don't exhaust yourself.

477
28:09.599 --> 28:10.319
Young Master,

478
28:10.319 --> 28:11.319
there's no need for this.

479
28:11.519 --> 28:12.519
Young Master!

480
28:12.759 --> 28:15.039
Put me down!

481
28:17.599 --> 28:18.720
Careful, Young Master.

482
28:20.119 --> 28:21.039
Watch your step.

483
28:21.039 --> 28:22.039
Young Master!

484
28:22.119 --> 28:22.759
Young Master,

485
28:22.760 --> 28:24.359
could you please put him down?

486
28:24.759 --> 28:25.200
Young Master!

487
28:25.200 --> 28:25.559
Let go of me!

488
28:25.559 --> 28:26.000
Young Master!

489
28:26.480 --> 28:27.240
Hurry up!

490
28:27.240 --> 28:27.759
Let go of me!

491
28:27.760 --> 28:29.240
I said, let me go!

492
28:30.119 --> 28:31.319
Let us take him, Young Master.

493
28:31.759 --> 28:33.159
Don't anyone dare touch him!

494
28:33.160 --> 28:33.680
Let go of me!

495
28:33.680 --> 28:34.680
Just try me.

496
28:35.480 --> 28:37.240
Look at yourself, Young Master.

497
28:37.359 --> 28:39.535
You barely recovered from that severe reaction yesterday.

498
28:39.559 --> 28:40.720
Just let them help—.

499
28:41.559 --> 28:43.240
Let them carry him in for you.

500
28:43.400 --> 28:45.719
Why waste your own strength, right?

501
28:45.720 --> 28:46.920
Get out of my way, all of you!

502
28:47.559 --> 28:49.839
I handle my own business.

503
28:50.799 --> 28:51.400
Put me down!

504
28:51.400 --> 28:51.960
Anyone who stands in my way—.

505
28:51.960 --> 28:52.759
Won't die!

506
28:52.759 --> 28:53.759
I won't die!

507
28:54.640 --> 28:55.640
Go right ahead, sir.

508
28:55.641 --> 28:56.799
Handle it yourself.

509
28:57.640 --> 28:58.640
Put me down!

510
29:00.839 --> 29:01.640
Put me down!

511
29:01.640 --> 29:02.160
Young Master,

512
29:02.160 --> 29:02.880
we're already home.

513
29:02.881 --> 29:04.240
Can't you hear me? Put me down!

514
29:06.000 --> 29:07.400
Do we have a guest?

515
29:10.839 --> 29:13.319
Put me down!

516
29:13.480 --> 29:14.639
Brother.

517
29:14.640 --> 29:16.279
What brings you back?

518
29:19.200 --> 29:21.758
An artist friend opened an exhibition

519
29:21.759 --> 29:22.759
and invited me over.

520
29:22.960 --> 29:24.160
It happens to be nearby,

521
29:24.440 --> 29:25.559
so I dropped by to see you.

522
29:25.960 --> 29:27.159
Put me down!

523
29:27.160 --> 29:28.400
And who is this?

524
29:28.720 --> 29:29.720
Oh.

525
29:33.559 --> 29:34.480
Master P'Aya,

526
29:34.481 --> 29:36.441
this is our new servant hired to tend the garden.

527
29:37.839 --> 29:40.000
Hasn't Master Pao always looked after the garden?

528
29:40.400 --> 29:42.200
Why hire someone new?

529
29:45.119 --> 29:45.720
Well...

530
29:45.920 --> 29:47.080
It's like this, Master P'Aya.

531
29:47.839 --> 29:49.719
Master Pao had some personal matters at home,

532
29:49.720 --> 29:51.038
so she took a few days off.

533
29:51.039 --> 29:52.838
This is her son.

534
29:52.839 --> 29:53.759
He grew up around flowers

535
29:53.799 --> 29:54.815
and knows gardening inside and out,

536
29:54.839 --> 29:56.920
so we called him in for a few days

537
29:57.480 --> 29:59.679
so our rare blossoms wouldn't go neglected.

538
29:59.680 --> 30:00.480
Thank you for stepping in,

539
30:00.480 --> 30:01.480
young man.

540
30:05.160 --> 30:07.480
Look at all the dirt on your clothes.

541
30:07.519 --> 30:09.278
Go upstairs and change into fresh clothes.

542
30:09.279 --> 30:10.680
Join me for lunch in a bit.

543
30:13.200 --> 30:14.239
I'll look after the boy.

544
30:14.240 --> 30:15.479
Leave it to me, Young Master.

545
30:15.480 --> 30:16.480
Right.

546
30:16.759 --> 30:17.559
All right.

547
30:17.720 --> 30:18.720
I'll head upstairs first.

548
30:19.599 --> 30:20.599
See you in a bit.

549
30:25.720 --> 30:26.720
Follow me.

550
30:27.559 --> 30:28.559
Wait.

551
30:33.319 --> 30:34.319
Wipe your sweat.

552
30:39.039 --> 30:40.039
Thank you.

553
30:41.920 --> 30:44.199
How can two brothers from the same family

554
30:44.200 --> 30:45.960
be like night and day?

555
30:46.559 --> 30:48.239
This older brother is so gentle.

556
30:48.240 --> 30:49.240
This way, please.

557
31:00.039 --> 31:01.039
Jiang Weibang!

558
31:02.119 --> 31:02.920
I'm doomed.

559
31:02.960 --> 31:04.598
Please don't realize I'm the masseur

560
31:04.599 --> 31:06.640
who smothered you in soy sauce last night!

561
31:21.440 --> 31:22.639
Don't you recognize me?

562
31:22.640 --> 31:23.640
Jiang Weibang!

563
31:24.079 --> 31:24.839
You...

564
31:24.839 --> 31:25.839
You're...

565
31:26.759 --> 31:28.719
You're my college classmate Jiang Weibang, right?

566
31:30.880 --> 31:32.000
Li Milan, right?

567
31:32.640 --> 31:33.359
Long time no see.

568
31:33.360 --> 31:34.440
It really is you!

569
31:35.119 --> 31:37.279
What are the odds of us running into each other here?

570
31:38.359 --> 31:40.200
It's broad daylight. Don't be like that.

571
31:47.559 --> 31:49.919
Why are you dressed so stuffy now?

572
31:49.920 --> 31:52.039
Weren't you full of swagger back in the day?

573
31:52.880 --> 31:54.319
It's called being mature.

574
31:54.799 --> 31:57.119
You're a celebrity now and your mouth still has no filter?

575
31:57.160 --> 31:58.039
Right,

576
31:58.119 --> 31:58.880
mature.

577
31:59.119 --> 31:59.640
Hey,

578
31:59.839 --> 32:01.518
how do I look these days?

579
32:01.519 --> 32:03.319
Aren't I way hotter than back then?

580
32:04.839 --> 32:05.920
Nothing special.

581
32:08.480 --> 32:10.800
The cop just said you got picked up for selling something?

582
32:11.359 --> 32:12.359
It's nothing.

583
32:12.480 --> 32:14.640
Just some contraband.

584
32:16.039 --> 32:17.559
Seriously?

585
32:17.880 --> 32:19.759
With your guts, you'd dare to deal that stuff?

586
32:23.279 --> 32:26.599
It's not sex toys or something, is it?

587
32:28.440 --> 32:29.319
And if it is,

588
32:29.319 --> 32:30.319
do you want some?

589
32:31.039 --> 32:32.119
If you do,

590
32:32.319 --> 32:34.079
I'll give you a discount on the whole stash.

591
32:34.359 --> 32:35.639
Then open it up and show me.

592
32:35.640 --> 32:37.295
Let's see if there's anything I could use.

593
32:37.319 --> 32:38.359
No need to open it.

594
32:38.480 --> 32:39.160
Trust me.

595
32:39.319 --> 32:41.039
I guarantee you can use every single piece.

596
32:41.440 --> 32:43.600
How would I know if I can use it if I haven't seen it?

597
32:44.200 --> 32:45.558
Why haven't you changed one bit?

598
32:45.559 --> 32:46.759
Still treating me like a kid.

599
32:46.960 --> 32:49.079
What if it really is contraband like you said?

600
32:49.680 --> 32:50.680
What if I get arrested?

601
32:51.200 --> 32:53.400
And you still don't trust me, just like old times.

602
32:53.720 --> 32:54.319
Forget it.

603
32:54.480 --> 32:55.400
I don't have time for this.

604
32:55.400 --> 32:56.400
I have to get to work.

605
32:57.079 --> 32:58.079
Hey!

606
32:59.799 --> 33:01.519
What kind of work are you doing these days?

607
33:02.359 --> 33:04.295
You're really meddling in my business, aren't you?

608
33:04.319 --> 33:06.319
Do I need to report every job I take to you?

609
33:06.720 --> 33:07.959
Come on, old classmate.

610
33:07.960 --> 33:09.558
Don't be such a buzzkill.

611
33:09.559 --> 33:11.639
I'm just looking out for you.

612
33:11.640 --> 33:13.960
Old classmate.

613
33:17.480 --> 33:19.279
I haven't properly introduced myself yet.

614
33:19.519 --> 33:20.319
My name is Mingkun.

615
33:20.480 --> 33:21.559
I'm the head butler here,

616
33:21.799 --> 33:23.599
as well as Master P'Eng's personal secretary.

617
33:24.279 --> 33:25.318
If I remember correctly,

618
33:25.319 --> 33:26.798
your name is Pao Bei, right?

619
33:26.799 --> 33:27.240
Yeah.

620
33:27.559 --> 33:28.559
Mr. Mingkun,

621
33:29.480 --> 33:31.559
he claims my mother stole a diamond ring.

622
33:31.960 --> 33:33.479
What's really going on?

623
33:33.480 --> 33:34.879
Just as you've heard,

624
33:34.880 --> 33:36.358
we reviewed the security footage.

625
33:36.359 --> 33:38.079
It shows your mother entering the study,

626
33:38.400 --> 33:40.400
opening the safe, and taking something out.

627
33:40.720 --> 33:42.599
So we have reason to suspect

628
33:42.680 --> 33:45.583
that she was the one who took the diamond ring Madam left for the young master.

629
33:46.000 --> 33:47.000
That's impossible.

630
33:47.599 --> 33:49.399
My mother would never do something like that.

631
33:49.759 --> 33:50.880
She raised us to know

632
33:51.519 --> 33:52.896
poverty shouldn't break our spirit,

633
33:52.920 --> 33:54.840
and hardship can never compromise our integrity.

634
33:55.119 --> 33:56.599
She would definitely never steal.

635
33:56.799 --> 33:58.999
Speaking from my personal relationship with Master Bao,

636
33:59.119 --> 34:01.399
I don't believe she's the type to do such a thing either.

637
34:01.720 --> 34:04.319
However, with the video footage and her sudden disappearance,

638
34:04.839 --> 34:07.240
we have no choice but to treat her as the primary suspect.

639
34:07.559 --> 34:09.119
Still, please believe me.

640
34:09.280 --> 34:10.695
We'll get to the bottom of this as quickly as possible.

641
34:10.719 --> 34:12.840
If it turns out she had nothing to do with it,

642
34:13.119 --> 34:14.919
we will definitely clear your family's name.

643
34:14.920 --> 34:16.038
Then please let me go.

644
34:16.039 --> 34:17.360
Let me go find my mother.

645
34:17.840 --> 34:20.559
I know she can explain everything to me.

646
34:20.960 --> 34:22.336
There must be some misunderstanding.

647
34:22.360 --> 34:23.360
I can't.

648
34:23.400 --> 34:24.896
Keeping you here was the young master's order.

649
34:24.920 --> 34:27.199
I don't have the authority to simply let you leave.

650
34:30.519 --> 34:31.280
How about this?

651
34:31.440 --> 34:32.599
Stay and work here for now.

652
34:32.960 --> 34:33.800
For one thing,

653
34:33.840 --> 34:36.039
you'll be finishing your mother's shift today.

654
34:36.119 --> 34:38.119
Otherwise, it counts as an unexcused absence,

655
34:38.159 --> 34:39.159
and according to the rules,

656
34:39.160 --> 34:40.320
she would be penalized.

657
34:41.760 --> 34:42.239
I see.

658
34:42.360 --> 34:43.360
All right.

659
34:43.480 --> 34:45.959
I'll cover for my mom and work here today.

660
34:45.960 --> 34:46.679
Very well.

661
34:46.680 --> 34:47.840
Thank you for your hard work.

662
35:05.440 --> 35:06.440
A Pong,

663
35:06.760 --> 35:08.719
something urgent came up that I need to handle.

664
35:09.039 --> 35:11.239
When you're done, could you cover my shift at the shop?

665
35:17.199 --> 35:19.719
I have to work at the Chinese restaurant.

666
35:19.880 --> 35:20.360
Hey,

667
35:20.840 --> 35:21.840
a Chinese restaurant?

668
35:22.000 --> 35:23.920
It's been forever since I last had Chinese food.

669
35:23.960 --> 35:26.039
I'll go support your business today!

670
35:28.079 --> 35:28.679
This is too heavy.

671
35:28.719 --> 35:29.320
Let me carry it for you.

672
35:29.320 --> 35:29.760
Hey!

673
35:30.159 --> 35:31.279
Who are you looking down on?

674
35:31.519 --> 35:32.199
Hurry up.

675
35:32.480 --> 35:33.519
Give it back!

676
35:33.679 --> 35:35.639
Even if I give it back, do you even know the way?

677
35:36.400 --> 35:37.400
Give it back to me!

678
35:38.639 --> 35:39.639
You're so annoying!

679
35:40.239 --> 35:41.239
Where is he?

680
35:41.679 --> 35:42.919
You didn't let him go, did you?

681
35:43.000 --> 35:43.719
Without your orders,

682
35:43.719 --> 35:44.719
I wouldn't dare.

683
35:44.760 --> 35:45.839
He's still in the garden,

684
35:45.840 --> 35:47.400
finishing his mother's shift for today.

685
35:48.440 --> 35:49.440
Good.

686
35:51.000 --> 35:52.000
Young Master,

687
35:53.360 --> 35:55.039
are you going to see him?

688
35:55.159 --> 35:55.880
What?

689
35:55.960 --> 35:57.240
Are you trying to stop me again?

690
35:57.360 --> 35:58.440
I'm not trying to stop you.

691
35:58.719 --> 35:59.719
It's just that...

692
36:00.159 --> 36:01.439
Master P'Aya is still here.

693
36:01.440 --> 36:03.960
And you know the agreement explicitly stated

694
36:04.079 --> 36:05.079
that if you...

695
36:05.360 --> 36:07.079
That agreement again.

696
36:08.039 --> 36:09.880
Agreement, agreement!

697
36:10.159 --> 36:11.039
I'm just messing with him.

698
36:11.040 --> 36:12.360
Why do you keep bringing that up?

699
36:12.800 --> 36:13.800
Young Master, please.

700
36:14.039 --> 36:15.399
I'm worried you'll get carried away again.

701
36:15.400 --> 36:16.558
If you break the rules,

702
36:16.559 --> 36:17.559
you could...

703
36:18.800 --> 36:20.960
you could be kicked out of the house!

704
36:22.199 --> 36:24.718
How could I stand by and watch you get thrown out?

705
36:24.719 --> 36:26.118
I can't bear to see you go,

706
36:26.119 --> 36:27.119
Young Master!

707
36:28.599 --> 36:29.159
Fine.

708
36:29.519 --> 36:30.519
I got it.

709
36:30.639 --> 36:31.639
I know my limits.

710
36:33.199 --> 36:34.879
Once lunch is ready,

711
36:34.880 --> 36:35.919
I'll come to your room to let you know.

712
36:35.920 --> 36:37.280
Why don't you rest here for a bit?

713
36:38.639 --> 36:39.840
Rest? What for?

714
36:40.559 --> 36:41.638
I brought him back

715
36:41.639 --> 36:43.199
just to have some fun, didn't I?

716
36:44.599 --> 36:45.599
Young Master!

717
36:45.920 --> 36:46.920
Young Master!

718
36:49.920 --> 36:52.480
Great. All that acting for nothing.

719
37:48.719 --> 37:49.719
In broad daylight,

720
37:50.000 --> 37:52.239
why are you sneaking up on people like a ghost?

721
37:52.599 --> 37:53.799
You scared the life out of me!

722
37:54.000 --> 37:55.000
You little brat.

723
37:55.159 --> 37:56.159
Such a scaredy-cat.

724
37:56.960 --> 37:58.199
Who are you calling a brat?

725
37:58.559 --> 38:00.039
If I'm a brat, you're an old monster!

726
38:04.880 --> 38:06.600
Excuse me, Young Master. Please step aside.

727
38:06.639 --> 38:07.840
I need to get back to work.

728
38:11.480 --> 38:13.119
Please go sit over on that bench.

729
38:13.559 --> 38:14.199
Stop getting in my way.

730
38:14.199 --> 38:15.199
I still have a job to do.

731
38:37.239 --> 38:38.239
Come here.

732
38:39.039 --> 38:40.039
What now?

733
38:40.159 --> 38:41.159
Quit talking back.

734
38:41.639 --> 38:42.639
Come here.

735
38:46.639 --> 38:47.880
Say whatever you have to say.

736
38:48.280 --> 38:49.360
I need to get back to work.

737
38:49.559 --> 38:51.639
I still have a shift at the restaurant after this.

738
38:54.360 --> 38:54.679
Don't move.

739
38:54.679 --> 38:55.079
What are you doing?!

740
38:55.280 --> 38:56.280
What's wrong with you?

741
38:56.800 --> 38:57.800
Hold still.

742
39:23.800 --> 39:24.880
Are you out of your mind?!

743
39:25.199 --> 39:26.575
The only reason I haven't fought back

744
39:26.599 --> 39:28.519
is out of respect for your status as a big boss.

745
39:29.840 --> 39:31.960
Don't mistake me for a pushover.

746
39:32.960 --> 39:34.000
If you keep doing this,

747
39:34.599 --> 39:35.840
I really will hit you back!

748
39:39.840 --> 39:41.159
Look at you.

749
39:41.559 --> 39:43.039
Completely ungrateful.

750
39:44.079 --> 39:45.639
I saw you got pricked by a thorn

751
39:46.199 --> 39:48.279
and kindly helped disinfect it to stop the bleeding.

752
39:48.960 --> 39:50.280
Instead of thanking me,

753
39:50.360 --> 39:51.440
you threaten to hit me?

754
39:52.039 --> 39:53.119
It's not a snakebite!

755
39:53.280 --> 39:55.080
Did you really have to suck on it like that?!

756
40:01.840 --> 40:02.840
Besides,

757
40:03.239 --> 40:04.000
what you pulled on me yesterday—

758
40:04.001 --> 40:05.521
I haven't even settled that score yet!

759
40:05.679 --> 40:06.679
Get over here!

760
40:07.360 --> 40:08.039
Mingkun!

761
40:08.039 --> 40:08.559
Help me!

762
40:09.039 --> 40:10.320
Is your boss completely insane?!

763
40:11.199 --> 40:12.000
Don't worry.

764
40:12.119 --> 40:13.119
He's just teasing you.

765
40:16.320 --> 40:18.120
Master P'Aya asked you to join him for lunch.

766
40:20.920 --> 40:22.320
Fine. Got it.

767
40:25.079 --> 40:26.199
After I finish lunch,

768
40:26.760 --> 40:27.960
we'll keep playing.

769
40:40.519 --> 40:41.519
Mingkun,

770
40:41.760 --> 40:44.040
I think there's seriously something wrong with your boss.

771
40:45.599 --> 40:46.760
Please just let me go.

772
40:46.880 --> 40:48.695
I'm genuinely terrified that when he comes back,

773
40:48.719 --> 40:49.320
he'll...

774
40:49.360 --> 40:50.480
try something on me again.

775
40:51.840 --> 40:52.840
All right.

776
40:52.880 --> 40:54.400
I'll arrange to send you home shortly.
